{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/partner-worlds/dystopia-rising-evolution/1383976-dystopia-rising-alternates-to-momentum-in-power-use","id":1383976,"title":"Dystopia Rising - Alternates to Momentum in Power Use","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Partner Worlds","Dystopia Rising: Evolution"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-04-26T10:59:59-07:00","id":1383976,"title":"Dystopia Rising - Alternates to Momentum in Power Use","content":"Soo, the question for this thread is exactly what the title says - does anyone have any ideas for an alternate power activation system for psychic and faith edges rather than Momentum. The idea of restricting players from using their powers based on both a common pool of points and the agreement of the other players does not sit well with me, at all. So I want to change that. <br /> <br /> An idea could be to give each Psychic/Faith person a number of Power Points equal to either their edge rating or twice it, which means a max of either five or ten, with it refreshing a certain amount of time (be it session or less). <br /> <br /> I don't know what I would wnat to replace it with but I can say that I really really do not like the fact that Momentum is used as the energy for psychic or faith edges. Like at all.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-26T11:26:10-07:00","id":1383981,"title":"","content":"Maybe you could cause a stun condition that lasts for a while (until the end of the scene, or until shaken off (like non letal damage) and stacks for multiple uses. Instead of spending momentum you can cause this condition for each momentum that would be spent.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-26T11:39:17-07:00","id":1383983,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/partner-worlds/dystopia-rising-evolution/1383976-dystopia-rising-alternates-to-momentum-in-power-use?p=1383981#post1383981\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Maybe you could cause a stun condition that lasts for a while (until the end of the scene, or until shaken off (like non letal damage) and stacks for multiple uses. Instead of spending momentum you can cause this condition for each momentum that would be spent.</div> </div> </div> </div>Not a bad idea. Though it does mean I need to once again focus my attention on fully getting the whole not actually damaged yet still damaged damage system. hehe <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-26T13:33:34-07:00","id":1384007,"title":"","content":"It would not be a damage, but a condition that increase the difficulty of any action by 1 due to the mental fatigue. The character shake it off by spending a round and testing Integrity+ Resistance (or another skill that would be mental training, on the attribute could be social or Mental), each success reduce the difficulty increase by 1.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[